                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]I loved this game so much I rebuilt it.[/b]\n\nI played this as a kid and keep coming back for the nostalgia. Sadly it runs badly on modern Windows (crashes, display problems, hard to get working at all), so I rebuilt the engine myself.\n\n[b]It's free, open source, and uses your own copy of the game.[/b] If you want to play it again on a current PC, check the discussions or [url=https://github.com/supm3n/trench-engine]trench-engine on GitHub[/url].",
